## 3. 克隆（本地路径，`--no-hardlinks`）

```bash
export PATH="/c/Users/Leon/.workbuddy/binaries/PortableGit/versions/1.2.0/usr/bin:/c/Users/Leon/.workbuddy/binaries/PortableGit/versions/1.2.0/bin:$PATH"
cd /d/Projects/GitHub/platform32-mcp
git clone --no-hardlinks /d/Projects/GitHub/template-mcu-STM32F103C8T6   testbeds/template-mcu-STM32F103C8T6
git clone --no-hardlinks /d/Projects/GitHub/template-mcu-STM32G474-series testbeds/template-mcu-STM32G474-series
git clone --no-hardlinks /d/Projects/GitHub/template-mcu-STM32H723-series testbeds/template-mcu-STM32H723-series
git clone --no-hardlinks /d/Projects/GitHub/HUSTRadio/stm32-digital-clock  testbeds/stm32-digital-clock
```

输出（4 条全部 `done.` / exit 0）：

```
Cloning into 'testbeds/template-mcu-STM32F103C8T6'...    done.  exit=0
Cloning into 'testbeds/template-mcu-STM32G474-series'... done.  exit=0
Cloning into 'testbeds/template-mcu-STM32H723-series'... done.  exit=0
Cloning into 'testbeds/stm32-digital-clock'...           done.  exit=0
```

- `--no-hardlinks` 理由：避免克隆与原仓共享 object 硬链接，保证原仓字节零风险。
- 走本地文件系统路径，**不联网**。克隆自带 `origin` 指向本地路径（非 GitHub），符合"实验区不污染远端"。

